        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kathy Jordan, Sergi Bruguera, Pam Shriver, Martina Navratilova\n- Events: 1983 Virginia Slims of Houston – Doubles\n- Roles: former tennis players, defending champions\n- Places: United States, Catalonia, Spain\n\nFacts:\n- Kathy Jordan was born on December 3, 1959, and she is a former American tennis player.\n- In the 1983 Virginia Slims of Houston – Doubles, Kathy Jordan and Pam Shriver were the defending champions.\n- In the 1983 Virginia Slims of Houston – Doubles, only Pam Shriver competed, and she partnered with Martina Navratilova.\n- Sergi Bruguera i Torner was born on January 16, 1971, and he is a former professional tennis player from Catalonia, Spain.",
